<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Careers | Vaswani Group</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;700;900&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..900;1,400..900&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary-font: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            --secondary-font: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            --dark-color: #1a1a1a;
            --light-color: #f5f5f5;
            --accent-color: #d4af37;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--primary-font);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--light-color);
            color: var(--dark-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
            font-family: var(--primary-font);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 6rem); line-height: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); font-weight: 700; }
        h3 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; }
        p { font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem); font-weight: 400; max-width: 800px; margin: 1rem 0; }
        
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549880338-65ddcdfd017b?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1NjY5MzB8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNXx8YmFuZ2Fsb3JlJTIwY2l0eXxlbnwwfHx8fDE3MTcwMDM2MzZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero * {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .grid-section {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: left;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .grid-section {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            .grid-section:nth-child(even) .content-left { order: 2; }
            .grid-section:nth-child(even) .image-right { order: 1; }
        }

        .grid-section h3 {
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .grid-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .cta-section {
            background-color: var(--dark-color);
            color: var(--light-color);
            padding: 6rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta-button {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: var(--dark-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 1rem 3rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header style="position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; background: transparent; z-index: 10;">
        <div class="container" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1.5rem 2rem;">
            <div style="color: white; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px;">VASWANI</div>
            <nav>
                <a href="#" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 2rem;">Projects</a>
                <a href="#" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 2rem;">About Us</a>
                <a href="#" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 2rem;">Careers</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1 class="hero-title">BUILT FOR THE BOLD</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="section container">
        <div class="grid-section">
            <div class="content-left">
                <h3>A solid foundation built on integrity</h3>
                <p>We believe that a solid foundation is the cornerstone of success—not just in property development, but in building a team. Our company is built on the principles of **honesty, integrity, and ethics**, and these values are at the heart of everything we do. We nurture a culture of **high performance, innovation, trust, and collaboration** where every team member is valued, respected, and empowered to grow—both professionally and personally.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="image-right">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517048676732-d65bc937f952?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1NjY5MzB8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwzfHxjb2xsYWJvcmF0aW9uJTIwaW5ub3ZhdGlvbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3MTcwMDM2MzZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080" alt="Team members collaborating and innovating" class="grid-image">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section container">
        <div class="grid-section">
            <div class="content-left">
                <h3>Your path to mastery</h3>
                <p>We prioritize continuous learning, offering regular training programs to ensure our employees stay ahead in a fast-paced industry. Whether you’re just starting your career or looking to take it to the next level, we’ll help you achieve—and exceed—your potential. With us, you're not just building properties; you’re building a better future.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="image-right">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522204523234-8729aa6e993f?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1NjY5MzB8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyfHxjb250aW51b3VzJTIwbGVhcm5pbmclMjBwcm9mZXNzaW9uYWx8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzE3MDAzNjM2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080" alt="Professional in a training program, showing growth" class="grid-image">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="color:white; font-weight: 900;">Ready to make your mark?</h2>
            <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); max-width:600px; margin: 1rem auto 0;">In the dynamic world of real estate development and construction in Bangalore or Mumbai, Vaswani is the place to be. Let's build something extraordinary—together.</p>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Send Your Resume</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>